  "published": "2026-08-17T17:33:22.13Z",
  "releaseNotes": "TCMProject.Utilities: adds 7 dermocosmetic forms (SERUM=29, GUMMY=30, NAIL_LACQUER=31, PEEL_OFF_MASK=32, BAR=33, COLLODION=34, STICK=35) to MedicinePharmaceuticalFormEnum in TCMEnums. None have an equivalent in the DIGEMID vademecum (Medicine catalog is hybrid medicamento+dermocosmetico since the Dermapiel pilot, Harmonie Derm) — those products carry no Registro Sanitario. NAIL_LACQUER and COLLODION do exist as international pharmacopeial forms (EDQM Standard Terms / classic collodion) even without a DIGEMID equivalent. Non-breaking, additive.",
